 6-10-30\n\nSJSU unveils a Filipino American history mural on campus on Fr
 iday\, October 30. The project began as a student idea three years ago\, 
 when students noticed something missing in their history. The stories of 
 Filipino Americans are now a permanent part of SJSU history.
